WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
06:30 — Before school. Before school Bilqees steals ten minutes of Campus on her phone — progress she can see, not a vague intention.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
14:30 — iPad review. After classes the iPad review catches what stuck; she bookmarks one idea for tomorrow’s stolen minute.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
21:00 — Laptop practice. Laptop practice block at night is short and real — depth over a performance of busyness.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
21:50 — Records. Records on the laptop make the week visible; minutes used are logged, not romanticised.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
22:10 — Phone. Phone goodnight. Progress is a page, not a stage.

